  onlineorderid: 
}

docs {
  `GET /api/v2/onlineorderdetail/byonlineorderid/{onlineorderid}`

  List the items in an online order (shopping cart), optionally including items that were added by promotions.

  Required scope: `api/Read`

  Fill in the path parameters on the **Params** tab before sending.

  Optional query parameters are disabled; enable the ones you need on the **Params** tab.
}
